# Markdown stays local, never in the repo.
#
# Supersedes the individual CLAUDE.md / PRD / technical-design entries that
# used to live here — `*.md` already covers them. Note that ignoring a file
# does nothing once it is tracked, which is why CLAUDE.md sat in this list and
# in git at the same time; anything added here also needs `git rm --cached`.
*.md

